            "query": "EventID:4697 AND (ServiceFileName:(*pcap* OR *npcap* OR *npf* OR *nm3* OR *ndiscap* OR *nmnt* OR *windivert* OR *USBPcap* OR *pktmon*))",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
